{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"拟紧态射"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"拟紧态射"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$, 若 $X$ 的每个仿射开集的原像均为"},{"Local":{"url":"拟紧概形","text":"拟紧概形"}},{"Plain":", 则称 $f$ 为<strong>拟紧态射</strong>.</p>\n<p>定义中 “每个仿射开集” 的要求可以仅对某个开覆盖验证.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"拟分离态射","text":"拟分离态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}